        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-21T17:26:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, he's had practice. &nbsp;Going by the model that it takes 10K hours to become expert at something, he must be quite the chef. &nbsp;Even simple dishes would have several lifetimes of experience behind them.</p><p><span>Granted, he's going to come across new recipies and methods of cooking. &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>You know, someday he's going to bring down a supervillain through the power of an exquisite meal.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This puts an entirely new light on Ambuscade. Maybe he's just a very enthusiatic foodie, and believes only Haka can bring him the ultimate flavor experience. &nbsp;This could also be why he hates seeing Haka eating fast food.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
