        "created_at": "2013-06-21T18:26:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Something tasteful, but sincere. &nbsp;And that doesn't take up too much space, since he's had a lot of time to accumulate possessions (unless he doesn't really believe in them?)</p><p>I'd go with a \"World's Greatest Teacher\" balloon. &nbsp;Or have the students bake him cookies.</p>",
