      {
        "id": 65981,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-21T19:40:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that speaks immensely to Haka's perspective.&nbsp; He's not just baking for the kids that will use him as a jungle gym (which, I can only imagine, he is more that willing to be the best jungle gym ever) and immediately pick up on his warm nature.&nbsp; He's baking for the kids that are too closed off or scared to see past his intimidating physique.&nbsp; That shows someone who doesn't just engage with the children that do well in school, but with the ones that don't.&nbsp; The ones that need a little extra help.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
