        "created_at": "2013-06-22T02:49:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry if I'm late to the party, but…</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Aata is aware that he's a bit intimidating. Which is why he always bakes before going in to teach.&nbsp;Few kids can resist the tiny, individual serving pies that Haka makes from scratch.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Okay, this quote made my day, and it made me love Haka even more,</p>",
